## 1. requirements — 选品与需求 (Requirements)（4 条）
- [KGR-001-A] [MUST] Filter keywords using tiered KGR thresholds by search volume (SV<250: KGR<0.25; SV 250-1000: KGR<0.50; SV>1000: discard) before passing to development pipeline. (Source: RULE-KGR-001@v1.2.0)
- [REQ-001-A] [MUST] Require Opportunity Score >= 3.5 before initiating MVP development. (Source: RULE-REQ-001@v1.2.0)
- [REQ-001-B] [MUST] Disqualify keywords if top 5 SERP results lack interactive web tool landing pages. (Source: RULE-REQ-001@v1.2.0)
- [KGR-001-B] [MUST] Verify search intent via SERP analysis before committing to MVP build. (Source: RULE-KGR-001@v1.2.0)

## 2. engineering-assets — 工程安全 (Engineering Assets)（9 条）
- [ARCH-001-A] [BLOCK] · 不可覆盖 Always connect Supabase via port 6543 Transaction Pooler in Serverless API routes; never direct-connect 5432. (Source: RULE-ARCH-001@v2.0.0)
