- [RL-001-B] [BLOCK] · 不可覆盖 Enforce AbortController 15-second timeout and per-user token consumption ceiling on LLM routes. (Source: RULE-RATELIMIT-001@v2.0.0)
- [RL-001-C] [MUST] · 不可覆盖 Use Upstash Redis with HTTP/REST protocol in Serverless environment; never use TCP Redis connections. (Source: RULE-RATELIMIT-001@v2.0.0)

## 3. seo-geo — SEO & GEO 收录 (SEO Standard)（5 条）
- [GEO-001-A] [MUST] Deploy /llms.txt and /llms-full.txt in public/ to reduce AI search engine hallucination. (Source: RULE-GEO-001@v2.0.0)
- [GEO-001-B] [MUST] Submit URLs via IndexNow API on every new page release to accelerate Bing/Yandex indexing. (Source: RULE-GEO-001@v2.0.0)
- [SEO-001-A] [MUST] Batch 01 pSEO release must be strictly controlled within 10-30 pages with unique interactive data. (Source: RULE-SEO-001@v1.2.0)
- [GEO-001-C] [MUST] Inject SoftwareApplication & WebApplication JSON-LD schema in page <head> for AI search extraction. (Source: RULE-GEO-001@v2.0.0)
- [SEO-001-B] [MUST] Inject SoftwareApplication JSON-LD schema on tool pages and submit URLs via IndexNow API. (Source: RULE-SEO-001@v1.2.0)

## 4. cro-marketing — CRO 与分发 (Distribution & CRO)（3 条）
- [CRO-001-A] [MUST] · 不可覆盖 Implement zero-friction experience: let users use core feature without registration; only gate export/advanced features. (Source: RULE-CRO-001@v1.1.0)
- [CRO-001-B] [MUST] Never post direct product links on new Reddit accounts; post value-first story content to avoid spam filter bans. (Source: RULE-CRO-001@v1.1.0)
- [CRO-001-C] [SHOULD] Set pricing anchor: monthly subscription ($9.9) higher than lifetime deal ($19.9) to steer users toward recurring revenue. (Source: RULE-CRO-001@v1.1.0)

## 5. operations — 运营与合规 (Operations)（6 条）
- [CASE-001-B] [BLOCK] · 不可覆盖 Use a Merchant of Record (LemonSqueezy/Paddle) for cross-border tax compliance; never use raw Stripe personal account. (Source: RULE-CASE-001@v1.1.0)
- [OPS-001-A] [BLOCK] · 不可覆盖 Configure API daily spend ceiling alerts to automatically trigger circuit breakers upon threshold breach. (Source: RULE-OPS-001@v1.0.0)
