- [PRIV-001-B] [SHOULD] Provide data deletion request mechanism (GDPR Art. 17 Right to Erasure) via a /account/delete endpoint. (Source: RULE-PRIV-001@v1.1.0)
- [PRIV-001-C] [SHOULD] Use a Merchant of Record (LemonSqueezy/Paddle) so cross-border VAT/sales tax is collected and remitted by the MoR; only use self-managed tax calculation (e.g. Stripe Tax) when you file those taxes yourself. (Source: RULE-PRIV-001@v1.1.0)
